Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Workflow|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Workflow|
		|portletName|Page Comments|
		|workflowAssetType|Comment|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Workflow Configuration|
	And Workflow configure Workflow
		|workflowDefinition|Single Approver (Version 1)|
		|workflowResourceValue|Comment|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Page Comments Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Page Comments Page|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Page Comments|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Approve Page Comment PG
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Page Comments Page|
	And PageComment add With Workflow PG
		|commentAuthor|Test Test (You)|
		|commentBody|Page Comment Comment|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Page Comments Page|
	And PageComment view With Workflow PG
		|commentAuthor|Test Test (You)|
		|commentBody|Page Comment Comment|
		|commentStatus|Pending (Review)|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow assign To Me Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Page Comment Comment|
		|workflowAssetType|Comment|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Page Comments Page|
	And PageComment view With Workflow PG
		|commentAuthor|Test Test (You)|
		|commentBody|Page Comment Comment|
		|commentStatus|Pending (Review)|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow approve Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Page Comment Comment|
		|workflowAssetType|Comment|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Page Comments Page|
	And PageComment view PG
		|commentAuthor|Test Test (You)|
		|commentBody|Page Comment Comment|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Submissions|
	And Workflow goto View Completed Asset Via My Submissions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Page Comment Comment|
	Then PageComment view As Workflow Asset
		|commentBody|Page Comment Comment|
Scenario: Delete Comment
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Page Comments Page|
	And PageComment add With Workflow PG
		|commentAuthor|Test Test (You)|
		|commentBody|Page Comment Comment|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Page Comments Page|
	And PageComment view With Workflow PG
		|commentAuthor|Test Test (You)|
		|commentBody|Page Comment Comment|
		|commentStatus|Pending (Review)|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Submissions|
	And Workflow view My Submissions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Page Comment Comment|
		|workflowAssetType|Comment|
		|workflowDefinition|Single Approver|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And PageComment tear Down PG
		|pageName|Page Comments Page|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Submissions|
	Then Workflow view Default My Submissions CP
Scenario: Edit Comment Assigned To Me
Priority: 5
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Page Comments Page|
	And PageComment add With Workflow PG
		|commentAuthor|Test Test (You)|
		|commentBody|Page Comment Comment|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow assign To Me Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Page Comment Comment|
		|workflowAssetType|Comment|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Workflow view Task Assigned To Me Details
		|workflowAssetContent|Page Comment Comment|
		|workflowAssetTitle|Page Comment Comment|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Workflow goto Preview Edit
	And PageComment edit Comment Field
		|commentBody|EDIT Comment|
	And Button click Save
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	Then Workflow view Task Assigned To Me Details
		|workflowAssetContent|EDIT Comment|
		|workflowAssetTitle|EDIT Comment|
		|workflowTask|Review|
Scenario: Reject Page Comment PG
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Page Comments Page|
	When PageComment add With Workflow PG
		|commentAuthor|Test Test (You)|
		|commentBody|Page Comment Comment|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Page Comments Page|
	And PageComment view With Workflow PG
		|commentAuthor|Test Test (You)|
		|commentBody|Page Comment Comment|
		|commentStatus|Pending (Review)|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow assign To Me Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Page Comment Comment|
		|workflowAssetType|Comment|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow reject Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Page Comment Comment|
		|workflowAssetType|Comment|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow view Rejected Task
		|workflowAssetTitle|Page Comment Comment|
		|workflowAssetType|Comment|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Page Comments Page|
	Then PageComment view With Workflow PG
		|commentAuthor|Test Test (You)|
		|commentBody|Page Comment Comment|
		|commentStatus|Pending (Update)|

